<title>HONG KONG: CIBC sets call warrants on Guangnan.</title>
<headline>CIBC sets call warrants on Guangnan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce, London branch, said on Wednesday it issued 280 million American-style warrants on shares of Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$10.035	PREMIUM	   16.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.292	 GEARING	   3.82X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  30.APR.98	EXER LOT	  10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$11.15</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
